[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0010","text":"制作人，辛苦了\n谢谢你来接我"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0020","text":"嗯\n今天也辛苦了，羽那"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0030","text":"练习情况怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0040","text":"嗯——\n还算普通吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0050","text":"也没怎么被骂\n感觉应该还不错吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0060","text":"哈哈，是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0070","text":"不过果然，\n一个人还是有点寂寞呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0080","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0090","text":"到演唱会之前\n都是和阳希酱、路加酱在一起的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0100","text":"……是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0110","text":"但是，不是马上就有和阳希一起的工作了吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0120","text":"──！\n嗯！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0130","text":"是下次的收录对吧？\n呵呵，好期待呀～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0140","text":"……虽然和阳希酱一起也很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0150","text":"但是，如果能再次和路加酱──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0160","text":"作为CoMETIK一起工作就好了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02270000_01_0180","text":"嗯，是啊——"}]
